#: ../../source/reference/volumecollider.rst:13
msgid ""
"The VolumeCollider class provides functionality for defining a collider "
"with a specific volume. It supports both physical and trigger collider "
"modes, associated physics material, and can be integrated with other "
"components in a game or simulation to enable accurate collision detection"
" and response."
msgstr ""

